0 48 578 [
[(Pd provides at least four objects for doing conditional)]
[(computations. The [select] object tests its input against)]
[(its argument\050s\051, and outputs "bang" when they match. The)]
[([route] object works similarly but also copies data. In)]
[(other words, [route] takes a list, tests its first element,)]
[(and conditionally passes on the rest of the list.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
